{"parse": {"title": "9TH-10", "pageid": 97013, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-09\" title=\"9TH-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-11\" title=\"9TH-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B4.B9.E6.B4.9B.E8.92.99.E6.BC.A9.E6.B6.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"费洛蒙漩涡\">费洛蒙漩涡</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 费洛蒙漩涡</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Ant Mill</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>实<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>没<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>真<span class=\"color-value\"></span>正<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>动<span class=\"color-value\"></span>“<span class=\"color-value\"></span>命<span class=\"color-value\"></span>运<span class=\"color-value\"></span>”<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10910</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那座蓝色屋顶的茅屋一如既往地沉默着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>能量扰动学家在一片梦的投影中，发现了巴比伦之骰的真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如所有的历史学家一样，她尊敬相仿的规律。正如所有的占星师一样，她尊敬星轨的移动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>容忍错误不等于否认命运的真实性，相反，它证实了命运的存在。如果您对此有疑问，不妨问问伟大的赫拉克利特吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在无人观测的宇宙中，巴比伦之骰将永不停止地旋转。在无限长又无限短的时间里，它将为所有人赋予命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瞧，她已经闭上了眼睛！她尊重数字的偶然性，尊重命运的随机性，尊重巴比伦的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>否则，她自愿迷失于时间的间隙中，成为永恒徘徊的幽灵。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翌日。静穆的监狱大厅中，几乎所有科马拉的囚犯都聚集在了此处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在众人的视线下，面色严肃的奥克塔维奥走上了主持台。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_tanshou\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_tanshou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_tanshou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>首先，我必须向诸位澄清：昨日，发生在理想家先生身上的事情与我毫无干系。我愿以我未来的作家生涯起誓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>诸位皆知，我与理想家先生分别代表着美洲诗社的两个不同派别。<br />制定&lt;glitch&gt;不要自找麻烦条约&lt;/glitch&gt;[Let sleeping dogs lie]以来数月，我们一直保持着和平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>时至今日，我们仍然共同生存于瞭望塔的视线下，奉行着同样的行事原则。请诸位相信，我们与管理者们会共同努力，寻找理想家先生的下落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>奥克塔维奥小姐，无需自责，这并不是您的错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>分明是他先口出狂言，在精神上攻击了您！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下的窃窃私语自然也传到了另一派系的囚犯耳中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>嘿，你们这些家伙，对理想家先生放尊重一点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>理想家先生只是失踪了！在我们找到他之前，他就会完好如初地出现在我们所有人面前！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>趁早节哀吧，罗贝托！我只能说，你们很难再找到一个像他这样疯得彻底的领导者了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>主持人的轻咳打断了台下的争论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>……请诸位保持安静！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>按照条约，本次&lt;glitch&gt;科马拉议会&lt;/glitch&gt;[The Congress]的主持人应是理想家先生。由于他在那场意外中失踪，现在由我代理——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-522520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-522520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-522520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>抱歉。作为议会的监督者，我来晚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>属于外来者的脚步声响起，狱卒带领着访客出现在监狱大厅的入口处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>维尔汀小姐，昨晚，我查阅了监狱近半年的档案，但均一无所获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>科马拉监狱中，并没有关于德洛丝女士任何的官方书面记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>目前看来，只有狱医才知晓德洛丝女士的下落。我们有迫切见到监狱管理者的理由，希望您能安排。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>请理解，囚犯们的胡言乱语并不能代表什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>思索至面前人的身份，狱卒仍然缓和了措辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>但……基金会的诸位，如果你们确实有此诉求，我可以稍后再次去询问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>只不过，接待的时间不会是近几天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>在此之前，我诚挚邀请诸位参与今日的科马拉议会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>看这里的阵仗，难道每天大厅中都要办一场文学沙龙吗？科马拉监狱简直就是作家的天堂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>奥克塔维奥小姐，又见面了。今天是你来主持吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>也许在沙龙上，我们能撇开成见，好好聊聊文学本身！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>……你们来得正好。除了狱卒小姐外，我希望各位客人也能作为科马拉议会的公证人，就像法院的公民陪审团那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>很好，这的确是一个符合议会规则的提议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……？什么议会？什么公证人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这议会代表着什么？学科、流派、主义、语种还是叙事视角？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>并非如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奥克塔维奥低下头，深深地看了提问者一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>是命运的随机性，虚构集小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>命运的……随机性？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在她陷入了迷惑与恍惚之时，狱卒的声音却前所未有地高昂了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>来自基金会的诸位官方职员，请让我为大家介绍“科马拉议会”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>昨日发生的暴乱只是一场短暂的意外。在科马拉实验性全景监狱中，囚犯们自发性的秩序才是常态。科马拉议会正是在这种状态下诞生的最佳写照！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是囚犯们自主治理的方式？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>是的，囚犯们通过科马拉议会，分配精神药物、安排劳作场所、管理休憩时间。这一切都是自发的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的语气充满自豪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>我宣布，第七届科马拉议会正式开始！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_yihuidaoju\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_yihuidaoju\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_yihuidaoju.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音落下，奥克塔维奥取出一只残旧的彩票箱，以及一个捏在手上的小玩意儿。囚犯们像一个巨大的蚁群，井然有序地移动了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>一个纸皮做成的箱子，和一只4面、6面、8面、10面、12面、14面……20个面的纸质骰子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>正如所有的历史学家一样，我们尊敬相仿的规律。正如所有的占星师一样，我们尊敬星轨的移动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这是……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下的女孩情不自禁地喃喃道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-311415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-311415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-311415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>就像，<b><i>巴比伦之骰</i></b>……？那个凝集作品主题的麦高芬，那个无穷无尽的命运共生体，那个将人类的时间压成干瘪圆圈的符号？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>容忍错误不等于否认命运的真实性。相反，它证实了命运的存在。如果您对此有疑问，不妨问问伟大的赫拉克利特吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>在无人观测的宇宙中，骰子将永不停止地旋转……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div><i>“在无限长又无限短的时间里，它将为所有人赋予命运”……？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯们：</div><div>瞧，我已经闭上了眼睛！我尊重数字的偶然性，尊重命运的随机性，尊重骰子的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在囚犯高亢的宣读中，原作者的声音却显得迟疑而滞涩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div><i>“否则，我自愿迷失于时间的间隙中，成为永恒徘徊的幽灵。”</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我已经无法理解眼前的一切了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>但，好笑的是，我也许是那个最知道会发生什么的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>虚构集小姐，这些……全是你小说的内容吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>是的，无论是界限的咒语、历史学家、占星师还是赫拉克利特……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>难道说，接下来他们要让巴比伦之骰为一切赋予命运……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下女孩们的震惊并没有影响到台上的一切，议会仍在继续着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>第一次抽签将由我进行，它首先决定了本次议会的代表顺序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>议会主持人将二十面骰抛入纸箱，并遵循某种节奏开始了摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>投掷的结果是数字“<i><b>5</b></i>”。本次检定符合<i><b>科马拉议会投掷准则</b></i>中的初始先决条件，标准投掷顺序已被决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>何塞先生，请上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>作为团众中的&lt;glitch&gt;先攻&lt;/glitch&gt;[Initiative]，你需要第一个接受命运的裁定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>是我吗……好的，好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被点名的囚犯上前来，他接过那只仿佛随时就要破碎的彩票箱，晃动着，让那枚代表着荒唐命运的骰子在里面翻滚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骰子停止了转动，就这样，一个简单的数字决定了这名囚犯接下来数十天的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>是“<b><i>17</i></b>”！！太好了！！<b><i>17</i></b>是像沙丘之间的绿洲那样稀有的好数字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>判定值为“6+4+4+3”。根据<i><b>科马拉议会投掷准则</b></i>，何塞的奖励是60片利培酮、40片氯氮平、40片地西泮。与此同时，他将擢升为科马拉议会的文化管理员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>述职交接前，何塞需要在第一厕所完成为期七天的清扫任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>太……太好了！我早就有一个伟大的想法了！扫把在这里、清洁剂在这里、对了、还有马桶刷……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>我要写一本《科马拉监狱亲历记》♪<span style=\"font-size:83%\">要与每位成员进行一对一会谈</span><span style=\"font-size:66%\">♪要记下他们文学的火花爆炸的瞬间♪……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>接下来是爱德华多先生，请上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来者的面孔显然处于极度的精神紧张中。他的眼神闪烁不定，两撇眉毛在争夺眉心，牙齿也打着群架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅳ：</div><div>可……可是，我忘记了判定的准则……我什么都不记得了！该死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅳ：</div><div>很抱歉，奥克塔维奥小姐，我没有办法继续下去……！自从上次没有分配到药物后，我犯了好几次病，现在脑袋里塞不下任何一个字母……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>别紧张，爱德华多，遵从投掷准则是整个环节中最容易的事情。来吧，把手放上来，我会协助你进行掷骰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>囚犯一脸惊恐地照做了。跟随悬于空中的双手摇晃箱子——那是他唯一能做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>我很遗憾，爱德华多。你必须自愿踏入下水道的污秽中，并在墙上写下一个你眼下最为焦虑的、作品主题的关键词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅳ：</div><div>我……非常感谢您，奥克塔维奥小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅳ：</div><div>只是我的脑袋要裂开了。我想我需要休息一会儿，再循着臭味去往下水道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-522710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅳ：</div><div>然后，完成我的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>捂着脑袋的囚犯离去了。他步伐沉重，一无所获，眉心却反而得以舒展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>等等……！狱卒小姐，他们是在以骰子来决定一切吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>可爱德华多的病情看起来比何塞要严重多了，他才是那个最应该得到药物的人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我先前已经解释过，这是科马拉监狱自发诞生的高效管理模式。狱医阁下将一定数量的药物、食品等生活物资交由囚犯们，他们则通过自发的方式进行分配。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>这当中不需要管理层的介入，也不涉及到暴力事件——这就是科马拉相较于世上所有监狱的不同之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>而这一切……仅仅是因为“命运的随机性”吗？你们管那颗用纸皮糊成的骰子叫“命运”——这是哪门子的玩笑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>你需要冷静，虚构集小姐，这是囚犯们所共同认可的公平秩序。有时，我们必须正视它所带来的牺牲和代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……无论你我是否能理解，我们都不该干涉一项合理运行并卓有成效的规则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我身为“狱卒”的职责是维持秩序，而你，虚构集小姐，你也不具备定义这一切的资格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱卒深吸一口气。比起说服对方，她的话更是在说服自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>但是，如果这都在按照小说所运行，那一切都是早已被注定的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>维尔汀，你还记得我昨晚所提到的故事吗？巴比伦之骰的随机性中增加了一倍的幸运，也增加了一倍的罚码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我有印象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>从一次简单的失败开始，命运将会像链式反应一样无止境地溃败下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>爱德华多在下次、下下次和往后的每一次，都永远无法掷出大于10的点数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>而且最终，由巴比伦之骰所掌控的一切，只会导向毁灭……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看了看周围，发现如此具有重量的话语，竟然没有得到任何人的注目——一个也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……总而言之，爱德华多这辈子都不会获得任何的药物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>按照巴比伦之骰倍数的惩罚，在墙上写下关键词的瞬间，他就会迎来自身的终局！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>如果真的是这样，我得想办法改变这一切……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚构集冲向了讲台的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-522515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-522515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-522515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>等等，虚构集小姐！你要干什么？！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-10"}}